nexa-transport

Protocol contracts are derived from the Apache-2.0-licensed Nexa project
(https://github.com/dacely-cloud/nexa). The generated snapshot contains Nexa
gateway v1 method, event, content, tool, and NCAP data definitions, adapted for
standalone JSON validation and portable browser/Node.js consumption.

